type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="pointer-events-auto z-11 flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-medium text-white h-10 gap-0 rounded-full bg-black/15 px-3 backdrop-blur-md hover:bg-black/30 focus:bg-black/30" aria-label="编辑图片">编辑</button></div></div><div class="flex gap-2" data-testid="image-gen-overlay-right-actions"><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="pointer-events-auto z-11 flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-medium text-white group h-10 w-10" aria-label="分享此图片"><span class="flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-black/15 backdrop-blur-md group-hover:bg-black/30 group-focus:bg-black/30"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon fill-current" style="filter: drop-shadow(rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15) 0px 2px 4px);"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-2cb00440.svg#630ca2" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-tertiary hover:text-token-text-primary dark:hover:text-token-text-primary flex items-center gap-0.5 text-start dark:text-(--interactive-label-tertiary-default)">已思考 4s<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="icon-xs"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-2cb00440.svg#b140e7" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="45bfadc3-82b4-4220-8d78-c0def167ef98" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-5-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="39">可以，我建议你<strong data-start="7" data-end="27">不要再让 Cursor 自由发挥</strong>，要让它按“分区重做”。</p>
<p data-start="41" data-end="48">你现在问题是：</p>
<ol data-start="50" data-end="133">
<li data-section-id="pnbpar" data-start="50" data-end="59">
<p data-start="53" data-end="59">首屏太空</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="uuup0" data-start="60" data-end="73">
<p data-start="63" data-end="73">没有足球场压迫感</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="15j89g3" data-start="74" data-end="86">
<p data-start="77" data-end="86">卡片太小、太散</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="3w5ou8" data-start="87" data-end="99">
<p data-start="90" data-end="99">红黑金氛围不够</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1uip9lb" data-start="100" data-end="119">
<p data-start="103" data-end="119">不像参考图那种“整屏落地页”</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1pkrvlr" data-start="120" data-end="133">
<p data-start="123" data-end="133">内容没有贴紧用户转化</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="135" data-end="151">你直接复制下面给 Cursor：</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="153" data-end="684"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="复制" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-2cb00440.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>现在页面还是不对，请不要微调，重新按参考图结构重做首页。</span><br><br><span>核心要求：</span><br><span>1. 页面最大宽度 1200px，整体居中</span><br><span>2. 首屏必须占满视觉，不要大面积空白</span><br><span>3. 背景要有足球场感觉：</span><br><span>   - 深色球场草地纹理</span><br><span>   - 顶部体育场灯光</span><br><span>   - 红色火花粒子</span><br><span>   - 黑红金渐变</span><br><span>4. Hero 区必须像参考图：</span><br><span>   - 左边大标题</span><br><span>   - 右边加入TG卡片</span><br><span>   - 下方四个卖点标签</span><br><span>   - 中间有明显红色 CTA 按钮</span><br><span>5. 第二屏必须是左右两栏：</span><br><span>   - 左：今日免费重心大卡</span><br><span>   - 右：昨晚战绩表</span><br><span>6. 第三屏：</span><br><span>   - 为什么加入TG，6个功能卡片</span><br><span>   - 下方一条大红色加入TG横幅</span><br><span>7. 第四屏：</span><br><span>   - 左：今日重点赛事预告</span><br><span>   - 右：倒计时 + 球员剪影感觉</span><br><span>8. 所有模块边框用红色/金色发光</span><br><span>9. 按钮必须红色渐变，有发光，不要普通按钮</span><br><span>10. 字体要大、粗、有冲击力</span><br><span>11. 手机端要像APP，底部固定TG按钮</span><br><br><span>重点：</span><br><span>不要空白。</span><br><span>不要小卡片分散。</span><br><span>不要普通模板。</span><br><span>我要像香港足球TG引流落地页，不是普通网站。</span><br><br><span>请直接重构 index.html、styles.css、app.js。</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
