<p data-start="30" data-end="36">第一次安装：</p>
<h1 data-section-id="1pbo4hb" data-start="38" data-end="44">可能要：</h1>
<ul data-start="46" data-end="70">
<li data-section-id="1j2p076" data-start="46" data-end="52">
