lass="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span class="ͼg">export</span><span> </span><span class="ͼg">const</span><span> </span><span class="ͼm">recordStats</span><span> </span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span> {</span><br><span>  recent: </span><span class="ͼk">"7红2黑1走"</span><span>,</span><br><span>  winRate: </span><span class="ͼk">"70%"</span><span>,</span><br><span>};</span><br><br><span class="ͼg">export</span><span> </span><span class="ͼg">const</span><span> </span><span class="ͼm">todayMatches</span><span> </span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span> [</span><br><span>  {</span><br><span>    time: </span><span class="ͼk">"03:00"</span><span>,</span><br><span>    league: </span><span class="ͼk">"英超"</span><span>,</span><br><span>    home: </span><span class="ͼk">"曼联"</span><span>,</span><br><span>    away: </span><span class="ͼk">"利物浦"</span><span>,</span><br><span>    tag: </span><span class="ͼk">"重心"</span><span>,</span><br><span>  },</span><br><span>];</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="342" data-end="365">以后你每天只改这个文件，网站自动显示最新内容。</p>
<p data-start="367" data-end="379">给 Cursor 指令：</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="381" data-end="474"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="复制" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-2cb00440.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>帮我把首页的“昨晚战绩”和“今日赛事”改成读取 lib/mock-data.ts 数据。</span><br><span>以后我只需要修改这个文件，首页自动更新。</span><br><span>先不要接数据库，不要接API。</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<h3 data-section-id="1a9cury" data-start="476" data-end="495">方案 2：做后台管理，比较专业</h3>
<p data-start="497" data-end="508">以后你可以做一个后台：</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="510" data-end="528"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="复制" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-2cb00440.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>/admin</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="530" data-end="535">你进去填：</p>
<ul data-start="537" data-end="569">
<li data-section-id="1rzue0n" data-start="537" data-end="543">
<p data-start="539" data-end="543">今日赛事</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="ixx5a" data-start="544" data-end="550">
<p data-start="546" data-end="550">重心方向</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1on69bf" data-start="551" data-end="557">
<p data-start="553" data-end="557">昨晚战绩</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="yia6pf" data-start="558" data-end="562">
<p data-start="560" data-end="562">胜率</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1j4kdsk" data-start="563" data-end="569">
<p data-start="565" data-end="569">TG文案</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="571" data-end="581">保存后首页自动更新。</p>
<p data-start="583" data-end="595">给 Cursor 指令：</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="597" data-end="709"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="复制" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-2cb00440.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>帮我增加一个简单后台 /admin。</span><br><span>后台可以编辑：</span><br><span>1. 昨晚战绩：红、黑、走、胜率</span><br><span>2. 今日赛事：时间、联赛、主队、客队、标签</span><br><span>3. 首页TG文案</span><br><br><span>先用本地 JSON 文件保存，不要接数据库。</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<h3 data-section-id="1qjcj9e" data-start="711" data-end="731">方案 3：真正实时自动，后期再做</h3>
<p data-start="733" data-end="738">这个要接：</p>
<ul data-start="740" data-end="770">
<li data-section-id="12z4psi" data-start="740" data-end="750">
<p data-start="742" data-end="750">足球比分 API</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1u3eud" data-start="751" data-end="756">
<p data-start="753" data-end="756">数据库</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1o627i6" data-start="757" data-end="763">
<p data-start="759" data-end="763">定时任务</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1qsbysv" data-start="764" data-end="770">
<p data-start="766" data-end="770">后台审核</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="772" data-end="792">但你现在不建议马上做，成本高，也容易乱。</p>
<p data-start="794" data-end="802">你现在最佳路线：</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="804" data-end="865"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="复制" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-2cb00440.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>先 mock-data.ts 手动更新</span><br><span>→ 再做 /admin 后台</span><br><span>→ 最后接 API 自动更新</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="867" data-end="872" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">这样最稳。</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="回复操作" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="复制回复" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-2cb00440.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="喜欢" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="good-response-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-2cb00440.svg#51753c" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="不喜欢" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="bad-response-turn-action-button" data-