<p data-start="525" data-end="528">现在：</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="530" data-end="569"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="复制" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-2cb00440.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>像 Tailwind 默认组件</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="571" data-end="574">
<h1 data-section-id="1nz4jp5" data-start="576" data-end="586">你现在真正需要：</h1>
<h1 data-section-id="iud2lb" data-start="588" data-end="602">UI 渲染 Prompt</h1>
<p data-start="604" data-end="616">不是结构 Prompt。</p>
<hr data-start="618" data-end="621">
<h1 data-section-id="44jeur" data-start="623" data-end="639">你现在应该这样改（非常重要）</h1>
<p data-start="641" data-end="653">直接发给 Cursor：</p>
<p data-start="655" data-end="658">复制：</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="660" data-end="1086"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="复制" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-2cb00440.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>现在不要改布局。</span><br><br><span>现在进入“UI渲染阶段”。</span><br><br><span>当前页面太像后台系统。</span><br><br><span>我要：</span><br><span>香港足球预测站视觉。</span><br><br><span>重点：</span><br><span>增加视觉渲染、灯光、层次、氛围。</span><br><br><span>要求：</span><br><br><span>1. Hero 背景：</span><br><span>- 黑红渐变</span><br><span>- 足球场灯光</span><br><span>- 金色光斑</span><br><span>- 红色氛围光</span><br><span>- 暗绿色草地纹理</span><br><span>- 烟雾粒子感</span><br><br><span>2. 页面整体：</span><br><span>- 不要纯黑</span><br><span>- 增加层次渐变</span><br><span>- 增加顶部环境光</span><br><span>- 增加卡片阴影</span><br><br><span>3. 卡片：</span><br><span>- 红色发光边框</span><br><span>- hover 发光</span><br><span>- 玻璃拟态</span><br><span>- 背景半透明</span><br><br><span>4. 按钮：</span><br><span>- 红色渐变</span><br><span>- hover 放大</span><br><span>- glow 发光</span><br><br><span>5. Hero 标题：</span><br><span>- 更大</span><br><span>- 更有压迫感</span><br><span>- 金色 + 白色</span><br><span>- 类似世界杯宣传页</span><br><br><span>6. TG卡：</span><br><span>- 更高级</span><br><span>- 更亮</span><br><span>- 更像VIP区域</span><br><br><span>7. 页面不要像后台。</span><br><span>要像：</span><br><span>世界杯投注平台首页。</span><br><br><span>重点：</span><br><span>这是视觉渲染阶段。</span><br><span>不要再修改结构。</span><br><span>只增强视觉氛围。</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="1088" data-end="1091">
<h1 data-section-id="1oxbq5v" data-start="1093" data-end="1103">你现在真正开始：</h1>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1105" data-end="1135"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="复制" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-2cb00440.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>做“高级感”</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
