<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="13" data-end="42"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="复制" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-2cb00440.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>世界杯氛围</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="44" data-end="48">了。🔥</p>
<p data-start="50" data-end="58">你现在要做的是：</p>
<h1 data-section-id="yfxdyh" data-start="60" data-end="73">不要直接放“普通图片”</h1>
<p data-start="75" data-end="78">而是：</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="80" data-end="111"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="复制" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-2cb00440.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>做“背景融合”</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="113" data-end="120">否则会很廉价。</p>
<hr data-start="122" data-end="125">
<h1 data-section-id="11op1ld" data-start="127" data-end="140">你现在正确做法（重要）</h1>
<h1 data-section-id="1n3v3zj" data-start="142" data-end="152">Hero 背景：</h1>
<p data-start="154" data-end="157">应该：</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="159" data-end="202"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="复制" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-2cb00440.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>图片 + 渐变 + 模糊 + 灯光融合</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="204" data-end="207">
<h1 data-section-id="1lmnh9z" data-start="209" data-end="229">你现在直接发给 Cursor（复制）</h1>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="231" data-end="651"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="复制" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-2cb00440.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>现在开始增加世界杯背景图。</span><br><br><span>要求：</span><br><br><span>1. Hero 背景增加：</span><br><span>世界杯奖杯 / 足球场 / 球迷灯光</span><br><br><span>2. 不要直接完整显示图片。</span><br><span>要：</span><br><span>- 模糊融合</span><br><span>- 背景化</span><br><span>- 半透明</span><br><span>- 暗化处理</span><br><br><span>3. 图片只作为氛围层：</span><br><span>- 不要抢文字</span><br><span>- 不要太亮</span><br><span>- 不要像Banner广告</span><br><br><span>4. 处理方式：</span><br><span>- background-image</span><br><span>- background-size: cover</span><br><span>- overlay 黑红渐变</span><br><span>- blur</span><br><span>- opacity</span><br><span>- radial-gradient 灯光</span><br><br><span>5. 左边标题区域必须清晰。</span><br><br><span>6. 整体感觉：</span><br><span>像世界杯宣传页</span><br><span>不是普通海报。</span><br><br><span>7. Hero 背景层次：</span><br><span>第一层：世界杯图</span><br><span>第二层：黑红渐变</span><br><span>第三层：红色灯光</span><br><span>第四层：暗绿色草地纹理</span><br><br><span>8. 增加：</span><br><span>顶部红光</span><br><span>边缘金色光晕</span><br><span>烟雾感</span><br><br><span>目标：</span><br><span>高级感 + 世界杯氛围 + 香港足球预测站。</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="653" data-end="656">
<h1 data-section-id="1n2ockd" data-start="658" data-end="668">另外（非常重要）</h1>
<p data-start="670" data-end="677">你现在背景图：</p>
<h1 data-section-id="1mebb55" data-start="679" data-end="685">最好用：</h1>
<h2 data-section-id="1dlvv5" data-start="687" data-end="697">1）世界杯奖杯</h2>
<h2 data-section-id="vs9ps1" data-start="699" data-end="708">2）球场灯光</h2>
<h2 data-section-id="s5wkcn" data-start="710" data-end="718">3）观众席</h2>
<p data-start="720" data-end="723">不要：</p>
<p data-start="725" data-end="756">❌ 太花<br data-start="729" data-end="732">
❌ 很多球员<br data-start="738" data-end="741">
❌ 高清海报<br data-start="747" data-end="750">
❌ 五颜六色</p>
<hr data-start="758" data-end="761">
<h1 data-section-id="1a45h3j" data-start="763" data-end="773">最佳做法（重点）</h1>
<p data-start="775" data-end="778">其实：</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="780" data-end="814"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="复制" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-2cb00440.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>背景图只负责“氛围”</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
