ost relevant venue, neighborhood, or event location, include it on the map while you explain the doodle. Answer the user's visible prompt using this doodle context:\",\"starter_prompt\":\"What is AAPI Heritage Month SF Downtown Block Party ft. Jai Wolf \u0026 Friends, and what happens at the downtown block party?\",\"light_image_url\":\"https://persistent.oaistatic.com/chatgpt/doodles/2026-05-21-to-2026-05-24-manual-dark-oled-review/may-21/sf/may-21_SF_light-mode.png\",\"office_label\":\"San Francisco\",\"starter_question\":\"Can you explain the context behind this ChatGPT homepage doodle? It was created for AAPI Heritage Month SF Downtown Block Party ft. Jai Wolf \u0026 Friends in San Francisco, using downtown block-party energy, AAPI celebration, music/DJ set, street-festival atmosphere. What event is it referencing, and how do those details tell the story?\",\"event_title\":\"AAPI Heritage Month SF Downtown Block Party ft. Jai Wolf \u0026 Friends\",\"dark_image_url\":\"https://persistent.oaistatic.com/chatgpt/doodles/2026-05-21-to-2026-05-24-manual-dark-oled-review/may-21/sf/may-21_SF_dark-mode.png\"}}},\"is_device_based\":false,\"passed\":false},\"1426425582\":{\"name\":\"1426425582\",\"rule_id\":\"17VVk7pNONw7H7GlS2Jhw1\",\"secondary_exposures\":[],\"id_type\":\"userID\",\"value\":{\"enabled\":true},\"is_device_based\":false,\"group_name\":\"Live-only create\",\"is_experiment_active\":true,\"is_user_in_experiment\":true},\"2076138851\":{\"name\":\"2076138851\",\"rule_id\":\"3QigorHh71tggge0e0kFbD\",\"secondary_exposures\":[],\"id_type\":\"userID\",\"value\":{\"max_concurrency\":20},\"is_device_based\":false,\"group_name\":\"20\",\"is_experiment_active\":true,\"is_user_in_experiment\":true},\"3635154224\":{\"name\":\"3635154224\",\"rule_id\":\"default\",\"secondary_exposures\":[],\"id_type\":\"userID\",\"value\":{\"connector_to_allowed_with_approval_scopes\":{\"connector_691eab1e001081919e57189f8b2f03bc\":[\"HEALTH\"],\"asdk_app_6945d9d84c5c8191a28343ae9d7b6e8b\